      "date": "2026-02-16T00:08:01.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: ₹1.30 loss per share (vs ₹7.19 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: ₹1.30 loss per share (improved from ₹7.19 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹302.2m (down 74% from 3Q 2025). Net loss: ₹17.7m (loss narrowed 67% from 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 26% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 39% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
